5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin this trial with open hearts. I hope we can find the truth together through calm dialogue.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Logic and observation will be our best tools here. Let's see how everyone behaves.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,This is like a mystery game! I'm going to find the werewolf no matter what!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"It's a bit nerve-wracking, but I'll do my best to help the village. Let's all get along.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will be observing. It is better to listen first and analyze the patterns of speech.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your enthusiasm is refreshing. Just remember that patience is often the key to discovery.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, you seem very cautious. Are you planning to stay silent for a while?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not just enthusiastic, I'm a detective! I'll spot a lie from a mile away!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,I hope we can trust each other. Does anyone have any initial thoughts?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I am simply gathering data. There is no need to rush into accusations on day zero.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, rushing leads to errors. Let us enjoy the process of deduction.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'm curious to see who will try to lead the group and who will hide in the shadows.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm not hiding! I'm right here!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Mizuki, you seem very confident. It's reassuring to have someone so composed.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Confidence can be a mask, or a genuine trait. I will keep that in mind.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"A wise observation, Ryuji. Let us move to the night.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
