32,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning. I hope everyone slept peacefully, despite the tension.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I slept well. Now, does anyone have any information they wish to share?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I had a dream that the werewolf was someone really scary! But I can't remember who!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"That's a scary dream, Sakura. I feel a bit anxious today.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I have information. Mizuki is the werewolf.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a very bold claim to make so early, Ryuji. Are you the Seer?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Ryuji, that is a blatant lie. I am a villager. Why would you target me so aggressively?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Whoa! A reveal already? Is Ryuji really the Seer?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"This is so sudden. Ryuji, are you sure? You're usually so cautious.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I am the Seer. I divined Mizuki last night, and the result was clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"If Ryuji is the Seer, the logic is simple. However, we must consider if he is a werewolf lying to frame Mizuki.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. Ryuji is trying to eliminate me quickly to secure a win. It's a classic strategy.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Sakura,,But Ryuji is so serious! He doesn't seem like he'd lie just for fun!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm torn. Ryuji's certainty is strong, but Mizuki's calm is also convincing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I have no reason to lie. The most logical path to victory is to identify the wolf immediately.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,"In the interest of the village, we should trust the Seer's divination unless there is proof otherwise.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Servas, you are trusting him too easily. Think about the risk of executing an innocent.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I believe Ryuji! Let's go with the Seer!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I trust Ryuji's judgment. I'm sorry, Mizuki.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,The evidence is the divination. Vote accordingly.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
